      : "Washington's GSS is now a conditional 60; seven other judgments are unchanged. RES is 40 and the others are 60, giving a conditional centre of 58. Current attacks and a bystander injury, an intercepted plot aimed at the White House, local coordination and event resumption are assessed with protective-learning and resource gaps. National threats and historical protective incidents are not local attack rates; allegations are not convictions and a plot is not executed harm. Ordinary life and essential corridors remaining normally usable, scope and continuity are reversible inferences; targeted-community harm is not averaged away. Rejecting GSS assumptions removes the centre, giving 49–64. New support for GSS 40 or 80 would give centres of 55 or 61. Other access, affordability, clinical-safety and boundary assumptions remain; a complete conditional centre grants no global qualification.",
