      : "New York adds conditional 60 judgments for PCS/GSS and 40 for RES; its other five 60 judgments are unchanged, giving a conditional centre of 58. Actual rain/snow maintenance and response and cross-state gate operations are reviewed alongside heat, flood and cold harm. IED/synagogue danger, historical gang consequences and current response/restoration and corridor reviews support limited security impact; 2026 indictments do not turn old injuries into current casualties. RES 40 rests on actual food-need budget shortfalls across income bands, retaining actual 2026 energy discounts and supply restoration. SPM is not FPL/AMI or exact local median income; overlapping studies are not independent confirmation and energy models are not post-aid measurements. Resident, core-city/FUA representativeness, persistent constraints and mitigation remain assumptions; rejecting a necessary assumption withdraws its dimension and the total's centre. Withdrawing PCS/GSS/ISR/MED gives 49–64, RES gives 54–64, and LON/TEC/OPT gives 52–62. Six approximate points do not establish complete areas or resident coverage. Neither the centre of 58 nor its arithmetic position proves qualification.",
