      ? "源名 Osaka [Kyoto] 是一个功能区，GSS 补为条件性 60，现七维 60、MED 未定；无总分中心，数学域 51—66。实际组织暴力受害／拦阻、世博警备结果、当前抗争管制和战略快照支持有限影响与缓解，仍须接受通常生活／通道、范围和延续假设；检举数不是死伤数，人员短板及针对性伤害保留。拒绝 GSS 假设回到 42—72。京都院方新闻声明 2026-09-25 刊登质量表，不认证截止前同字节；其他医院好过程不平均到全区，也不解释京都低时点。实际误摘和结果未跟进伤害、已做培训／规则与拟整改并列，低值解释、整改效果及普通居民替代可及仍未知，MED 不补 60／40。原退院窗不是全部手术发生窗，两病例与 iPSC 路径不证明普遍疗效／交付；七个近似点不验证完整地域或治疗点。"
      : "Osaka [Kyoto] is one candidate area. GSS is now a conditional 60, giving seven 60 judgments with MED unresolved: no total centre and a mathematical domain of 51–66. Actual organised-violence harm/interception, Expo policing results, current gang-conflict controls and strategic snapshots support limited impact and mitigation, requiring ordinary-life/corridor, scope and continuity assumptions. Clearance counts are not casualties; staffing constraints and targeted harm remain. Rejecting GSS assumptions restores 42–72. Kyoto's official news claims the indicators were posted on 25 September 2026, without authenticating pre-cutoff bytes. Other providers' good processes are neither pooled into a FUA rate nor used to explain Kyoto's low timing value. Actual wrong-site resection and missed-result follow-up harms remain alongside completed training/rules and planned remedies. Low-value interpretation, remedy effects and ordinary timely alternatives remain unresolved; MED receives neither a default 60 nor 40. Discharge dates are not all procedure dates; two cases and iPSC pathways establish neither general efficacy nor delivery. Seven approximate points do not establish complete boundaries or treatment sites.",
