      : "Shanghai has five conditional 60 judgments, LON and OPT 40, and TEC 80, giving a conditional centre of 58. Multiple producers, actual digital use and completed assistance support the high TEC anchor. Flooding, water-system failure and nursing-process gaps are read alongside operating protection, routine care and recovery. Chongming and Kunshan references belong to other candidates; municipal totals are not local resident rates. Directory associations determine research sequence only.",
    zh
      ? "LON 40 保留真实给药、监护和日间减负，也保留经济／交通退出与当前住院责任不自动覆盖不足 24 小时路径的错位；有实际可承担门诊或医学合理住院支付支持，可审 60。407 人是七院队列，ARIA 为 39/321、症状 4/321，15 人混合主观退出不全是经济原因；无对照认知变化不证明疗效或延寿。任何必要居民、范围、延续或残余重要性假设拒绝即撤回该维与中心，不证明全球入围。"
      : "LON 40 retains real treatment, monitoring and reduced day-care burden alongside economic/transport withdrawals and the mismatch between the observed under-24-hour pathway and current inpatient cover. Supported affordable outpatient or clinically appropriate covered inpatient alternatives could justify 60. The 407 patients span seven hospitals; ARIA is 39/321 and symptomatic ARIA 4/321. Fifteen mixed subjective withdrawals are not all financial. Uncontrolled cognitive changes prove neither efficacy nor longer life. Rejecting a necessary resident, scope, continuity or residual-materiality assumption withdraws that dimension and the centre; global qualification remains unproven.",
  ],
};
const caseReviewLinks: Record<number, { href: string; label: string }> = {
  [jakarta.candidateId]: {
    href: "https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-jakarta-technology-longevity-exit-review.md",
    label: zh ? "长寿、技术与资金通道原件复核" : "Longevity, technology and financial-path sources",
  },
  [shanghai.candidateId]: {
    href: "https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-shanghai-technology-longevity-exit-review.md",
    label: zh
      ? "上海临床、技术与退出通道复核"
      : "Shanghai clinical, technology and exit-path review",
  },
  [beijing.candidateId]: {
    href: "https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-beijing-technology-longevity-exit-review.md",
    label: zh
      ? "北京技术、临床与离开路径复核"
      : "Beijing technology, clinical and exit-path review",
  },
  [washington.candidateId]: {
    href: "https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-washington-security-review.md",
    label: zh
      ? "华盛顿安全原件与相邻档位复核"
      : "Washington security sources and adjacent-anchor review",
  },
  [seoul.candidateId]: {
    href: "https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-seoul-clinical-review.md",
    label: zh ? "临床证据与改档条件" : "Clinical evidence and conditions for revision",
  },
  [prague.candidateId]: {
    href: "https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-prague-clinical-review.md",
    label: zh ? "布拉格临床复核" : "Prague clinical review",
  },
  [chicago.candidateId]: {
    href: "https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-chicago-clinical-review.md",
    label: zh ? "医疗质量、资格与临床路径复核" : "Quality, eligibility and clinical-pathway review",
  },
  [lisbon.candidateId]: {
    href: "https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-lisbon-clinical-review.md",
    label: zh ? "医疗等待、质量与临床路径复核" : "Waiting, quality and clinical-pathway review",
  },
};
---

<section id="global-research" class="cci-section" aria-labelledby="global-research-title">
  <div class="cci-section-heading">
    <h2 id="global-research-title">
      {zh ? "全球 Top 32 研究进展" : "Global Top 32 research progress"}
    </h2>
    <p class="research-date">
      {zh ? "研究更新" : "Research update"} · <time datetime="2026-10-12">2026-10-12</time>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="research-overview">
    <div>
      <p class="research-conclusion">
        {
          zh
            ? "全球 Top 32 尚未确定。现有案例用于校准评分规则，入围结论仍需验证其他候选。"
            : "A global Top 32 has not been established. Current cases calibrate the scoring rules; inclusion still needs to be tested against other candidates."
        }
      </p>
      <p class="research-note">
        {
          zh
            ? `独立研究进度，不属于上方所选历史发布。已登记的 ${n(coverage.candidateCount)} 个功能城市区中，${n(coverage.scoreStatusCounts.not_computed_under_global_protocol)} 个仍未完成全球统一规则下的完整评分；局部证据关联不是合格城市数或完成率。`
            : `Separate from the historical release selected above. Of ${n(coverage.candidateCount)} registered functional urban areas, ${n(coverage.scoreStatusCounts.not_computed_under_global_protocol)} still lack complete assessments under the common global protocol. Partial evidence links are not qualified cities or completion rates.`
        }
      </p>
    </div>
    <dl class="research-progress" aria-label={zh ? "评分研究进度" : "Scoring research progress"}>
      <div>
        <dt>{zh ? "已审阅案例" : "Cases reviewed"}</dt>
        <dd>
          {n(cases.length)}{zh ? " 份 · 八维及 31 个子支柱" : " · Eight dimensions, 31 subpillars"}
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>{zh ? "条件性评分" : "Conditional assessments"}</dt>
        <dd>
          {
            zh
              ? `${n(screening.completeConditionalCaseCount)} 份完整 · ${n(screening.partialCaseCount)} 份部分判断`
              : `${n(screening.completeConditionalCaseCount)} complete · ${n(screening.partialCaseCount)} partial`
          }
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>{zh ? "待审阅候选" : "Candidates awaiting review"}</dt>
        <dd>
          {n(screening.unassessedCount)}{
            zh ? " 个 · 尚无此类八维审阅" : " · No such eight-dimension review"
          }
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <nav class="research-nav" aria-label={zh ? "研究进展导航" : "Research progress navigation"}>
    <a href="#local-calibration">{zh ? "评分案例" : "Scorecards"}</a>
    <a href="#case-reviews">{zh ? "判读依据" : "Case evidence"}</a>
    <a href="#research-boundaries">{zh ? "候选边界" : "Candidate boundaries"}</a>
    <a href="#publication-scope">{zh ? "出榜条件" : "Publication scope"}</a>
  </nav>
  <div id="local-calibration">
    <h3>{zh ? "当地居民评分校准" : "Local-resident scoring calibration"}</h3>
    <dl class="research-profile">
      <div>
        <dt>{zh ? "评价对象" : "Resident profile"}</dt>
        <dd>
          {
            zh
              ? "本国公民，通常长期居住，当地中位收入和通常医保。"
              : "Local citizens who usually reside in the city, at median local income and with usual healthcare coverage."
          }
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>{zh ? "评价时点" : "Assessment period"}</dt>
        <dd>
          {
            zh
              ? "2026 年 · 证据截止 2026-10-10；后续复核另记实际查阅日期。"
              : "2026 · Evidence cutoff: 10 October 2026. Subsequent checks record actual retrieval dates."
          }
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <p class="research-note">
      {
        zh
          ? "评分依赖明确假设，不表示每项均有充分测量。“—”表示未定，不能填零或生成总分。"
          : "Scores depend on explicit assumptions, not complete measurements. “—” means unresolved, with no zero imputation or total centre."
      }
    </p>
    <p id="research-table-hint" class="research-table-hint">
      {
        zh
          ? "表格可横向滚动；点击城市名称查看对应依据。"
          : "Scroll the table horizontally; select a city name to find its evidence."
      }
    </p>
    <div
      class="cci-table-scroll research-table"
      tabindex="0"
      aria-label={zh ? "条件性评分案例" : "Conditional scoring cases"}
      aria-describedby="research-table-hint"
    >
      <table>
        <caption
          >{
            zh
              ? "条件性成绩单 · 用于校准，不是排名"
              : "Conditional scorecards · calibration, not a ranking"
          }</caption
        >
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">{zh ? "城市／功能区" : "City / functional area"}</th>
            {
              DIMENSIONS.map(dimension => (
                <th scope="col">
                  <abbr title={cciCopy[currentLang].dimensions[dimension.id].name}>
                    {dimension.id}
                  </abbr>
                  <small>{dimension.weight}%</small>
                </th>
              ))
            }
            <th scope="col">{zh ? "条件总分" : "Conditional total"}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {
            cases.map(city => (
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">
                  <a href={`#research-case-${city.candidateId}`}>
                    {zh ? (caseNamesZh[city.candidateId] ?? city.name) : city.name}
                  </a>
                </th>
                {DIMENSIONS.map(dimension => (
                  <td>{city.dimensions.find(d => d.id === dimension.id)?.score ?? "—"}</td>
                ))}
                <td class="research-total">{city.expectedConditionalTotal ?? "—"}</td>
              </tr>
            ))
          }
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <details id="case-reviews" class="research-fold">
      <summary>{zh ? "逐城判读依据与反证" : "Case judgments and counterevidence"}</summary>
      <div class="research-case-list">
        {
          cases.map(city => (
            <details class="research-case">
              <summary>
                <span>{zh ? (caseNamesZh[city.candidateId] ?? city.name) : city.name}</span>
                <span class="research-case-status">
                  {city.expectedConditionalTotal === null
                    ? zh
                      ? "部分维度判断"
                      : "Partial assessment"
                    : zh
                      ? "完整条件评分"
                      : "Complete conditional assessment"}
                </span>
              </summary>
              <div id={`research-case-${city.candidateId}`} class="research-case-body">
                {caseNotes[city.candidateId].map(note => (
                  <p>{note}</p>
                ))}
                <div class="research-links">
                  <a
                    href={`https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/${city.evidenceReview}`}
                  >
                    {zh ? "完整案例与原件" : "Full case and sources"}
                  </a>
                  {caseReviewLinks[city.candidateId] && (
                    <a href={caseReviewLinks[city.candidateId].href}>
                      {caseReviewLinks[city.candidateId].label}
                    </a>
                  )}
                </div>
              </div>
            </details>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </details>
    <details id="research-assumptions" class="research-fold">
      <summary>{zh ? "共同评分假设与入围审查" : "Shared assumptions and shortlist review"}</summary>
      <div class="research-reading">
        <p>
          {
            zh
              ? "新加坡条件性总分现为 60，伦敦为 58；2 分差不证明确定优劣。医疗等待不能仅因超出行政目标就自动取 40；科研强不能代替居民扩散；长期迁居权不能覆盖交通、资金及通信的全部退出条件。长寿路径的代表性假设最需挑战：若不接受该假设，LON 应保持未定，总分中心也应为空。"
              : "Singapore now has a conditional total of 60 and London 58; this two-point gap does not establish superiority. Missing an administrative waiting target does not automatically imply MED 40; strong research does not establish resident diffusion, and residence rights do not cover every transport, financial or communication condition. Longevity pathway representativeness is the weakest assumption: rejecting it leaves LON unresolved and removes the total's central estimate."
          }
        </p>
        <p>
          {
            zh
              ? `同一规则审阅了 2026 年一至八月的初步组织暴力：${n(currentViolence.candidatesWithClearPreciseEvents)} 个候选有保留的 Clear 编码点，${n(currentViolence.candidatesWithPendingPreciseEvents)} 个有待核查编码点，两组可重叠，均不是完整安全影响或 GSS 分数。跨月重复、后版修订、粗位置、时点冲突及异常值分别保留。纽约一条记录引用的原文描述涉嫌 2024 年双重谋杀与 2026 年起诉，已隔离而未计为当年新增死亡。修改时间和发布周期仅支持截止日前可用的假设，独立历史存档尚未核验。无保留归属不证明安全；上一轮十案例的档位未被此材料改变，洛杉矶 GSS 也仍未定；后续须补当地完整影响、区域／战略暴露和实际缓解。`
              : `A consistent review covers preliminary organised violence for January–August 2026: ${n(currentViolence.candidatesWithClearPreciseEvents)} candidates have retained Clear coded points and ${n(currentViolence.candidatesWithPendingPreciseEvents)} have pending coded points; groups can overlap, and neither establishes complete safety impacts or GSS scores. Monthly overlaps, later revisions, coarse locations, temporal conflicts and anomalous values remain separate. One New York record cites a source describing an alleged 2024 double murder and a 2026 indictment; it is quarantined rather than counted as new deaths. Modification times and the release schedule support only an assumption of pre-cutoff availability; an independent historical archive is unverified. An absence of retained assignments does not establish safety or absent violence. The preceding ten case judgments were unchanged by this review; Los Angeles GSS also remains unresolved; complete local impacts, regional and strategic exposure, and actual mitigation still need evidence.`
          }
          {" "}<a
            href="https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-ucdp-candidate-2026-review.md"
            >{zh ? "当年事件与共同判档检验" : "Current-event and shared-anchor review"}</a
          >
        </p>
        <p>
          {
            zh
              ? `已对现有全量矩阵检视提前排除是否有依据：${n(screening.retainedCount)} 个候选全部保留，有依据的排除为 ${n(screening.supportedExclusionCount)}。其中 ${n(screening.completeConditionalCaseCount)} 个有完整条件性中心、${n(screening.partialCaseCount)} 个仅有部分维度判断，${n(screening.unassessedCount)} 个尚无此类八维审阅。筛查只检查现有证据能否排除候选，不等于完成全量评分；局部底表和条件性分数均不能作为可靠排除界限。下一步补证须覆盖仍可能改变入围结论的竞争者。`
              : `An exclusion screen of the assembled matrix retains all ${n(screening.retainedCount)} candidates, with ${n(screening.supportedExclusionCount)} supported exclusions. Reviews include ${n(screening.completeConditionalCaseCount)} with complete conditional centres and ${n(screening.partialCaseCount)} with partial judgments; ${n(screening.unassessedCount)} candidates lack such eight-dimension reviews. This checks whether current evidence supports exclusion, not whether every city has been fully scored. Partial sources and conditional scores establish no reliable exclusion bounds. Further assessment must cover competitors that could change the shortlist.`
          }
        </p>
        <p>
          {
            zh
              ? `全候选入围可判定性演算已覆盖 ${n(rankAudit.candidateCount)} 个冻结功能区、${n(Object.keys(rankAudit.scenarios).length)} 组情景。即使暂时固定已有条件性判断，赫尔辛基的算术位置仍可为 ${n(helsinkiPosition.bestPosition)}—${n(helsinkiPosition.worstPosition)}；其余竞争者仍未知，不能把少数案例的比较当作入围证明。逐维撤回必要假设后，总分中心为空。未知项的 0—100 是数学域端点，不是评分、概率或可靠城市界限；较新未匹配中心亦未被排除。`
              : `A shortlist-identifiability calculation covers all ${n(rankAudit.candidateCount)} frozen areas across ${n(Object.keys(rankAudit.scenarios).length)} scenarios. Even temporarily fixing existing conditional judgments leaves Helsinki's arithmetic position between ${n(helsinkiPosition.bestPosition)} and ${n(helsinkiPosition.worstPosition)}. Unassessed competitors remain unknown; comparisons among a few cases cannot prove membership. Withdrawing a dimension's necessary assumptions removes the total's centre. The 0–100 endpoints for unknowns are mathematical domains, not scores, probabilities or reliable city bounds; newer unmatched centres are also not excluded.`
          }
          {" "}
          <a
            href="https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-local-2026-rank-audit.md"
            >{zh ? "查看演算与逐行结果" : "Review the calculation and every candidate row"}</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
  <details id="research-boundaries" class="research-fold">
    <summary>{zh ? "候选边界与评价对象" : "Candidate boundaries and resident perspectives"}</summary
    >
    <div class="research-reading">
      <p>
        {
          zh
            ? `UCDB R2024A 有 ${n(boundaries.centreOverlapCounts.no_overlap)} 个中心与旧功能区无交集；WUP 2025 的 ${n(wup.urbanCentres)} 个中心中有 ${n(wup.centreOverlapCounts.no_overlap)} 个无交集，其中 ${n(wup.wupCentresOutsideFuaAndUcdb)} 个也与 UCDB 无交集。两套来源的数量不能直接相加，边界迁移仍未解决。未收录、未匹配或资料缺失均不代表表现较差。`
            : `${n(boundaries.centreOverlapCounts.no_overlap)} UCDB R2024A centres do not overlap the older functional areas. Of ${n(wup.urbanCentres)} WUP 2025 centres, ${n(wup.centreOverlapCounts.no_overlap)} have no such overlap, including ${n(wup.wupCentresOutsideFuaAndUcdb)} that also do not overlap UCDB. Counts from the two sources cannot be added together; boundary migration remains unresolved. Omission, unmatched boundaries and missing data are not negative assessments.`
        }
      </p>
      <p>
        {
          zh
            ? `旧候选范围之外的 ${n(coverage.outsideFrameReview.recordCount)} 条未匹配中心记录已逐条保留，按跨来源交集组成 ${n(coverage.outsideFrameReview.reviewGroupCount)} 个边界复核组，其中 ${n(coverage.outsideFrameReview.groupsWithIndirectFuaLink)} 组存在间接旧 FUA 联系。这些是记录与复核组数量，不是去重城市数；间接联系不证明居民已被覆盖，也不继承分数。其八维与总分均未定，当前名次演算仍只限于旧 ${n(coverage.candidateCount)} 个功能区。范围缺口已接入资格检查，尚不能发布全球 Top 32。`
            : `All ${n(coverage.outsideFrameReview.recordCount)} unmatched centre records outside the old frame are retained in ${n(coverage.outsideFrameReview.reviewGroupCount)} boundary-review groups based on cross-source overlap; ${n(coverage.outsideFrameReview.groupsWithIndirectFuaLink)} groups have indirect links to old FUAs. These are record and review-group counts, not deduplicated city counts. Indirect links establish neither resident coverage nor inherited scores. All eight dimensions and totals remain unresolved; position arithmetic still covers only the older ${n(coverage.candidateCount)} functional areas. The scope gap is now included in eligibility checks; a global Top 32 cannot yet be published.`
        }
        {" "}
        <a
          href="https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-unmatched-centre-review.md"
          >{zh ? "查看未匹配中心逐条登记" : "Review every unmatched centre record"}</a
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        {
          zh
            ? "后续分别评价当地普通居民与跨国迁居者，沿用八维权重，各自审查入围名单，不合成单一榜单。跨国视角的基准人物参数仍待明确；当前发布未应用这两种视角。"
            : "Future assessments will distinguish ordinary local residents from international movers, retaining the eight weights and reviewing each shortlist separately. The mover profile remains unspecified; neither perspective has been applied to the current release."
        }
      </p>
      <p>
        {
          zh
            ? `人口覆盖核查已遍历全部 ${n(coverage.boundaryPopulationCoverage.centreCount)} 个 WUP 2025 中心：${n(coverage.boundaryPopulationCoverage.centresWithKnownOutsidePopulation)} 个有抽样模型人口落在旧功能区全集之外，其中 ${n(coverage.boundaryPopulationCoverage.centresWithPartialKnownPopulationCoverage)} 个同时有区内和区外人口。“有交集”不能证明居民已全覆盖。这是投影人口与整格抽样，不是新增城市数、实际服务覆盖率或评分；边界迁移仍待核。`
            : `Population coverage was checked across all ${n(coverage.boundaryPopulationCoverage.centreCount)} WUP 2025 centres. ${n(coverage.boundaryPopulationCoverage.centresWithKnownOutsidePopulation)} have sampled projected population outside the union of older functional areas, including ${n(coverage.boundaryPopulationCoverage.centresWithPartialKnownPopulationCoverage)} with population both inside and outside. An intersection does not establish complete resident coverage. These are projections sampled by whole cells, not new city counts, measured service coverage or scores; boundary migration remains unresolved.`
        }
        {" "}
        <a
          href="https://github.com/realmorrisliu/realmorrisliu.com/blob/main/docs/cci-wup-population-coverage.md"
          >{zh ? "查看全量人口覆盖计算" : "Review the full population coverage calculation"}</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details id="publication-scope" class="research-fold">
    <summary>{zh ? "出榜条件与名称" : "Publication conditions and scope"}</summary>
    <div class="research-reading">
      <p>
        {
          zh
            ? `先按同一规则评分，再验证入围边界；不必等所有数据完美，但需要解释入围者为何排在其他候选之前。当前只有 ${n(screening.completeConditionalCaseCount)} 份完整条件评分，尚不满足任何前 32 发布条件。`
            : `Apply the same scoring rules, then test the shortlist boundary. Perfect data are not required, but inclusion must be justified against competing candidates. Only ${n(screening.completeConditionalCaseCount)} complete conditional assessments are currently available; none of the Top 32 publication conditions is met.`
        }
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>
          {
            zh
              ? "至少 32 城完成统一评价，公开关键假设和敏感性：可以发布“已评估城市中的 CCI 前 32”，明确已评估范围。"
              : "With at least 32 consistently assessed cities and disclosed assumptions and sensitivity, publish “CCI Top 32 among assessed cities”, identifying the assessed scope."
          }
        </li>
        <li>
          {
            zh
              ? "整个声明的候选范围均已评价，或有充分依据排除未深入评估者：可以发布“该候选范围内的 CCI 研究前 32”。仍可能入围的未知候选必须保留。"
              : "When the entire declared candidate scope is assessed, or sufficient evidence excludes candidates not assessed in depth, publish “CCI research Top 32 within the declared scope”. Unresolved candidates that could qualify must be retained."
          }
        </li>
        <li>
          {
            zh
